  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline WASABI is a four-sided square co-polyester string designed for aggressive spin production. Its sharp edges create strong mechanical ball grip and bite, while a super-slick coating reduces inter-string friction and enhances snapback. This combination allows WASABI to generate spin through both direct ball interaction and rapid string return. Despite its aggressive geometry, Toroline also positions WASABI as having a softer response than many traditional shaped co-polys. It is available in Pomegranate Red, Neon Green and Neon Pink, all in 1.23 mm / 17 gauge.",

    "zh": "Toroline WASABI 是一款采用四边形 Square 截面的高旋转共聚酯球线。四条锐利边缘能够直接抓住网球毛毡，提供强烈的机械咬球和旋转；同时球线表面采用 Super-Slick 超光滑涂层，降低主横线之间的摩擦并提升 Snapback。因此 WASABI 同时利用 Ball Grip 与 Snapback 两种机制制造旋转。虽然外形非常具有攻击性，但 Toroline 同时强调它拥有相对柔和的击球反馈。产品统一采用 1.23 毫米 / 17 规格，提供 Pomegranate Red、Neon Green 与 Neon Pink 三种颜色。"
  },

